(5762473, 838336, 111808, '<td valign="top">Love the colours &amp; detailled focus of the subject in this photo. The delicate orange yellow lines which make up the symmetry of the butterfly''s crinkle wing patterns stand out crisp with great contrast against the black. The sharp relief makes this a joy to view and appreciate.</td>', 'Love the colours & detailled focus of the subject in this photo. The delicate orange yellow lines which make up the symmetry of the butterfly''s crinkle wing patterns stand out crisp with great contrast against the black. The sharp relief makes this a joy to view and appreciate.', '2009-12-09 22:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
