(5763351, 838473, 15511, '<td valign="top">The simplicity and limited palette in your image are its strong features. Perhaps greater depth of field to focus about half the remaining body could improve the overall effect.</td>', 'The simplicity and limited palette in your image are its strong features. Perhaps greater depth of field to focus about half the remaining body could improve the overall effect.', '2009-12-10 19:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
