(5763441, 838485, 25355, '<td valign="top">I guess this was a case of desperation being the mother of invention. ;-)<br/>Creativ, as well.</td>', 'I guess this was a case of desperation being the mother of invention. ;-)Creativ, as well.', '2009-12-10 21:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
