(5763681, 838368, 65592, '<td valign="top">A tigher crop would add a lot to this image. Love the color contrast between the bug and the leaf.</td>', 'A tigher crop would add a lot to this image. Love the color contrast between the bug and the leaf.', '2009-12-11 04:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5763747, 837451, 112788, '<td valign="top">I find that I cannot stop looking at this pic. There is something very unearthly about it. The translucent nature of the head and body just behind is breathtaking. The colour and DOF is spot on.</td>', 'I find that I cannot stop looking at this pic. There is something very unearthly about it. The translucent nature of the head and body just behind is breathtaking. The colour and DOF is spot on.', '2009-12-11 07:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
