(5764234, 838149, 83845, '<td valign="top">Tells a story for sure.  Not fond of the big border.  Very very cute and great composition otherwise.</td>', 'Tells a story for sure.  Not fond of the big border.  Very very cute and great composition otherwise.', '2009-12-11 19:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764236, 837661, 83845, '<td valign="top">There''s something about this photo that really captures me.  It is very painterly.  My favorite of the challenge so far.</td>', 'There''s something about this photo that really captures me.  It is very painterly.  My favorite of the challenge so far.', '2009-12-11 19:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764238, 838154, 83845, '<td valign="top">The bokeh in the background and the patterns in the web are very beautiful!  So much so that it''s hard to focus on the subject.  A great photo however.</td>', 'The bokeh in the background and the patterns in the web are very beautiful!  So much so that it''s hard to focus on the subject.  A great photo however.', '2009-12-11 19:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764242, 837283, 83845, '<td valign="top">Holy crap, that IS a weird fat bug.  I''ve never seen a bug with such small eyes.  He looks like a mole with the legs of a fly!  Great photo, by the way.  :D</td>', 'Holy crap, that IS a weird fat bug.  I''ve never seen a bug with such small eyes.  He looks like a mole with the legs of a fly!  Great photo, by the way.  :D', '2009-12-11 19:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764244, 838487, 83845, '<td valign="top">This is extraordinary!  One of my top 3 if not best of the challenge.</td>', 'This is extraordinary!  One of my top 3 if not best of the challenge.', '2009-12-11 19:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764265, 838096, 110186, '<td valign="top">Ewww! What kind of spider is that?</td>', 'Ewww! What kind of spider is that?', '2009-12-11 20:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764267, 837809, 110186, '<td valign="top">You captured some very nice detail, and I really like the overall picture.</td>', 'You captured some very nice detail, and I really like the overall picture.', '2009-12-11 20:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764271, 838351, 110186, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture of the details, especially the pollen and the eyes. I would be surprised if this one doesn''t ribbon.</td>', 'Fantastic capture of the details, especially the pollen and the eyes. I would be surprised if this one doesn''t ribbon.', '2009-12-11 20:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764275, 837283, 110186, '<td valign="top">Weird, indeed! Great capture of details!</td>', 'Weird, indeed! Great capture of details!', '2009-12-11 20:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764277, 837694, 110186, '<td valign="top">Wow, great job on this photo. I like the perspective, too.</td>', 'Wow, great job on this photo. I like the perspective, too.', '2009-12-11 20:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764280, 838485, 110186, '<td valign="top">Ha ha, nice!</td>', 'Ha ha, nice!', '2009-12-11 20:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
