(5764312, 838141, 51084, '<td valign="top">Great portrait!  Was it hard to get him to pose?</td>', 'Great portrait!  Was it hard to get him to pose?', '2009-12-11 21:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764405, 838165, 29011, '<td valign="top">Cute! That looks like a ladybug larvae to me. The shot is somewhat overexposed. Not easy finding the right balance but if you can underexpose just a bit at times,  after tweaking the contrast/brightness, it might make the final shot noisier but you''ll have more details in the highlights.</td>', 'Cute! That looks like a ladybug larvae to me. The shot is somewhat overexposed. Not easy finding the right balance but if you can underexpose just a bit at times,  after tweaking the contrast/brightness, it might make the final shot noisier but you''ll have more details in the highlights.', '2009-12-12 01:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764439, 838007, 108580, '<td valign="top">Nice and close but with the result that antennae and leg is cropped off. I''m guessing you used ambient light and no ring or other flash so a bit lusterless. Still, a 6. <br/>I Came back to this on the w/e. Yor DOF is pretty good and detail is not bad, perhaps a little too much to the right of frame. Still bumped 1 to 7.</td>', 'Nice and close but with the result that antennae and leg is cropped off. I''m guessing you used ambient light and no ring or other flash so a bit lusterless. Still, a 6. I Came back to this on the w/e. Yor DOF is pretty good and detail is not bad, perhaps a little too much to the right of frame. Still bumped 1 to 7.', '2009-12-12 02:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764604, 838249, 90495, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2009-12-12 11:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
