(5769155, 838173, 44877, '<td valign="top">Well, dear Roz - I would have eaten my hat if you had not won this challenge. Needless to say, I did not vote on it. You can imagine how I would have fared looking at an entire bug challenge. But you manage to photograph vermin in the most aesthetic way - beautiful, really. <br/> <br/>Enormous congrats on not only your Blue, but an 8+ score!!!!!!!! That''s huge! I''m proud of you and happy for you! OXOX</td>', 'Well, dear Roz - I would have eaten my hat if you had not won this challenge. Needless to say, I did not vote on it. You can imagine how I would have fared looking at an entire bug challenge. But you manage to photograph vermin in the most aesthetic way - beautiful, really.  Enormous congrats on not only your Blue, but an 8+ score!!!!!!!! That''s huge! I''m proud of you and happy for you! OXOX', '2009-12-16 10:59:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5769156, 838173, 112911, '<td valign="top">Very Nice work and sense.Congrats!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-12-16 11:00:43.</i></td>', 'Very Nice work and sense.Congrats!', '2009-12-16 10:59:36.000000', '2009-12-16 11:00:43.000000', 0),
(5769160, 838173, 100831, '<td valign="top">Wow!!! Not surprised that you won the bug challenge but this is also probably the best bug photo ever!!! Congratulations, it''s really beautiful (and that''s a lot coming from someone who doesn''t like insects). Fabulous color.</td>', 'Wow!!! Not surprised that you won the bug challenge but this is also probably the best bug photo ever!!! Congratulations, it''s really beautiful (and that''s a lot coming from someone who doesn''t like insects). Fabulous color.', '2009-12-16 11:10:08.000000', NULL, 0),
