(5769308, 838173, 103142, '<td valign="top">That is totally, amazingly, unbelievable!! You should submit this to national geographics your shot. I would think it would be published in a heart beat! Congrats, and I never thought I''d see an 8+ shot. It''s the first I''ve ever seen in a challenge!</td>', 'That is totally, amazingly, unbelievable!! You should submit this to national geographics your shot. I would think it would be published in a heart beat! Congrats, and I never thought I''d see an 8+ shot. It''s the first I''ve ever seen in a challenge!', '2009-12-16 13:31:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5769322, 838173, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh, Roz!  Who''d have thought you''d win a bug challenge??  I mean, that''s totally out of the blue, isn''t it?  What with you being famous for your water drops and all....  Oh.  Wait.  That''s Irene.  You''re ... you''re the bug lady!  Oh!  Right!  What was I thinking...  (All in good fun, my dear.  And huge congrats on the 8+ score - that''s freakin'' amazing!  Are you going to retire now?)</td>', 'Oh my gosh, Roz!  Who''d have thought you''d win a bug challenge??  I mean, that''s totally out of the blue, isn''t it?  What with you being famous for your water drops and all....  Oh.  Wait.  That''s Irene.  You''re ... you''re the bug lady!  Oh!  Right!  What was I thinking...  (All in good fun, my dear.  And huge congrats on the 8+ score - that''s freakin'' amazing!  Are you going to retire now?)', '2009-12-16 13:43:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5769335, 838165, 98339, '<td valign="top">oh, so that''s what it is...excellent job....I should have a boat load of this ladybug larvae all over my yard now....lol (I got 1,500 ladybugs for this challenge and released them in my yard...hmmm)</td>', 'oh, so that''s what it is...excellent job....I should have a boat load of this ladybug larvae all over my yard now....lol (I got 1,500 ladybugs for this challenge and released them in my yard...hmmm)', '2009-12-16 14:03:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5769338, 838509, 98339, '<td valign="top">lol...so you had a ladybug too...great picture...I was surprised at how many ladybugs there were in this challenge...didn''t expect that...I had to go purchase my ladybugs (1,500)</td>', 'lol...so you had a ladybug too...great picture...I was surprised at how many ladybugs there were in this challenge...didn''t expect that...I had to go purchase my ladybugs (1,500)', '2009-12-16 14:06:52.000000', NULL, 0),
