(5769476, 838509, 67145, '<td valign="top">i''m really surprised that this didnt do heaps better libby .. its incredibly arty and beautiful .. i reckon the voters who dont look beyond their noses or think things have to be in your face marked you down or gave you ordinary votes coz you cant see all of the little ladybug .. to me that''s just a part of the huge appeal that this image has .. the colours like i said during voting are just wonderful .. they have a sort''v old fashioned/old painting feel .. like WOW .. anyway ... thanks for the pm .. quite often when i like something a lot, which i did with this and expected to be on the first page, well that can mean the kiss of death .. lol .. :)</td>', 'i''m really surprised that this didnt do heaps better libby .. its incredibly arty and beautiful .. i reckon the voters who dont look beyond their noses or think things have to be in your face marked you down or gave you ordinary votes coz you cant see all of the little ladybug .. to me that''s just a part of the huge appeal that this image has .. the colours like i said during voting are just wonderful .. they have a sort''v old fashioned/old painting feel .. like WOW .. anyway ... thanks for the pm .. quite often when i like something a lot, which i did with this and expected to be on the first page, well that can mean the kiss of death .. lol .. :)', '2009-12-16 16:41:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5769482, 837694, 108580, '<td valign="top">OK I''m eating my hat...<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blogs.ballyfermot.ie/philiphickey/files/2008/08/president-bush-eats-kitten-1259-300x232.jpg'', strrpos(''//blogs.ballyfermot.ie/philiphickey/files/2008/08/president-bush-eats-kitten-1259-300x232.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blogs.ballyfermot.ie/philiphickey/files/2008/08/president-bush-eats-kitten-1259-300x232.jpg"/> <br/>Hehe<br/>Great shot Doc</td>', 'OK I''m eating my hat... HeheGreat shot Doc', '2009-12-16 16:49:40.000000', NULL, 0),
