(5769592, 838173, 102315, '<td valign="top">Who gave the 1 and 2? I can''t image anyway giving this that sort of score. Conrats on the top finish. Excellent shot and thanks for the posting the original.</td>', 'Who gave the 1 and 2? I can''t image anyway giving this that sort of score. Conrats on the top finish. Excellent shot and thanks for the posting the original.', '2009-12-16 18:38:44.000000', NULL, 0),
