(5770930, 837710, 18367, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a well deserved ribbon. This is truly an amazing image and I was particularly impressed with the back lighting and the effect it has on the subject.<br/> <br/>I was ever so positive that this would do very well and am quite pleased that I managed to convince you to enter this one and not the spider image.  Good luck to you in future challenges.<br/> <br/>Ray</td>', 'Congratulations on a well deserved ribbon. This is truly an amazing image and I was particularly impressed with the back lighting and the effect it has on the subject. I was ever so positive that this would do very well and am quite pleased that I managed to convince you to enter this one and not the spider image.  Good luck to you in future challenges. Ray', '2009-12-17 23:47:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5770950, 838173, 81042, '<td valign="top">Roz, congratulations on an amazing picture and a unbelievable score. These flies are a headache to photograph because they are always on the move and tend to jump when the flash goes off. Your pics continue to motivate me to get out there with my macro. Unfortunately I was traveling to the US on this challenge and couldn''t get out to get a picture. All the best!</td>', 'Roz, congratulations on an amazing picture and a unbelievable score. These flies are a headache to photograph because they are always on the move and tend to jump when the flash goes off. Your pics continue to motivate me to get out there with my macro. Unfortunately I was traveling to the US on this challenge and couldn''t get out to get a picture. All the best!', '2009-12-18 00:05:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5770955, 838351, 39057, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen the eye of a bee look like that before. Makes me want to get my macro lens back. <br/> <br/>Very nice.</td>', 'I''ve never seen the eye of a bee look like that before. Makes me want to get my macro lens back.  Very nice.', '2009-12-18 00:06:50.000000', NULL, 0),
