(6125106, 838173, 59267, '<td valign="top">Roz, congratulations on your Eureka finalist and wish you good luck for the next stage. Your macro photos are amazing and this photo present the best timing of capturing the momentary life/death of tiny insects. We all observe the world but your observation is so sharp that you captured those events usually ignored by us. You deserve the top honor, congratulations!</td>', 'Roz, congratulations on your Eureka finalist and wish you good luck for the next stage. Your macro photos are amazing and this photo present the best timing of capturing the momentary life/death of tiny insects. We all observe the world but your observation is so sharp that you captured those events usually ignored by us. You deserve the top honor, congratulations!', '2010-08-09 21:11:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(6134973, 838173, 112828, '<td valign="top">CONGRATS ON THE WIN ROZ!!!!!<br/> <br/>They say a photo is worth 1000 words, well, that''s probably true, but we can now prove this photo is worth $5,000!<br/> <br/></td>', 'CONGRATS ON THE WIN ROZ!!!!! They say a photo is worth 1000 words, well, that''s probably true, but we can now prove this photo is worth $5,000! ', '2010-08-19 03:06:59.000000', NULL, 0),
